@startuml

title Conventions import by family

hide empty description

state "=staging=" as staging
state "=applying=" as applying
state "=applied=" as applied
state "=expired=" as expired

[*] --> staging : begin
staging --> staging : stage a family
staging --> applying : commit (row lock taken)
applying --> applied : every family applied
applying --> staging : apply refused, transaction rolled back
staging --> expired : sweep, past expires_at

note right of applying
    lives only inside the
    commit transaction, so a
    crash rolls back to staging
end note
note right of applied
    the recorded result is
    returned to any later commit
end note

@enduml
